2025-03-31 07:11:48 [http-nio-8080-exec-3] DEBUG f.a.common.logging.LoggingAspect - Enter: fa.appcode.services.impl.MasterDatumServiceImpl.setMasterDataToModel() with argument[s] = [{submit=false, delete=true, reject=false, approve=false, publish=true, unpublish=true, canEdit=true, school=SchoolFormManager(id=65, name=Pham Anh Tuan, typeId=2, address=Vinh Tuong, Vinh Phuc, cityId=4, cityName=Tỉnh Cao Bằng, districtId=40, districtName=Thành phố Cao Bằng, wardId=1273, wardName=Phường Hợp Giang, email=thanhnv@gmail.com, phone=0123456789, childReceivingAgeId=2, educationMethodId=2, feeTo=7000000.00000, feeFrom=5000000.00000, introduction=<p><strong>Welcome to [School Name] – A Place of Excellence in Education</strong></p><p>At <strong>[School Name]</strong>, we believe that education is the foundation of a bright future. Established with a vision to provide high-quality education, our school is dedicated to nurturing young minds, fostering creativity, and instilling strong values in every student. We are committed to academic excellence, character development, and holistic learning, ensuring that our students are well-prepared for the challenges of the future.</p><h3><strong>Our Vision and Mission</strong></h3><p>Our vision is to empower students with knowledge, skills, and values that will help them succeed in life. We strive to create a learning environment that promotes curiosity, critical thinking, and innovation. Our mission is to provide a well-rounded education that not only focuses on academic achievements but also on personal growth, leadership, and social responsibility.</p><h3><strong>A Supportive and Nurturing Environment</strong></h3><p>At <strong>[School Name]</strong>, we understand that every child is unique, with different learning styles and abilities. Our experienced and passionate teachers are dedicated to guiding each student on their educational journey. We foster a supportive and inclusive environment where students feel encouraged to express themselves, ask questions, and explore new ideas.</p><h3><strong>Academic Excellence and Innovative Learning</strong></h3><p>We take pride in offering a comprehensive curriculum that meets national and international educational standards. Our academic programs are designed to challenge students, develop their analytical skills, and encourage lifelong learning. We incorporate modern teaching methods, including technology-driven learning, project-based activities, and interactive classroom experiences to make education engaging and meaningful.</p><h3><strong>Extracurricular Activities and Personal Development</strong></h3><p>Education goes beyond textbooks, and at <strong>[School Name]</strong>, we place a strong emphasis on extracurricular activities. Our students have the opportunity to participate in various sports, arts, music, drama, and leadership programs. These activities help in building confidence, teamwork, and problem-solving skills, shaping them into well-rounded individuals.</p><h3><strong>State-of-the-Art Facilities</strong></h3><p>Our campus is equipped with modern facilities, including spacious classrooms, science and computer labs, a well-stocked library, sports fields, and creative arts spaces. We provide a safe and stimulating environment where students can learn, play, and grow.</p><h3><strong>A Community of Excellence</strong></h3><p>One of the key strengths of <strong>[School Name]</strong> is our strong sense of community. We work closely with parents, educators, and students to create a collaborative and inspiring atmosphere. Regular communication, parent-teacher meetings, and community events ensure that everyone is involved in the learning process.</p><h3><strong>Preparing Students for the Future</strong></h3><p>In today’s fast-changing world, education is not just about memorizing facts—it’s about developing critical thinking, adaptability, and a global perspective. At <strong>[School Name]</strong>, we equip our students with the necessary tools to excel in higher education and beyond. Whether they pursue careers in science, business, technology, arts, or any other field, they leave our school with the confidence and skills to make a positive impact on society.</p><h3><strong>Join Us at [School Name]</strong></h3><p>We invite you to become a part of our vibrant learning community. At <strong>[School Name]</strong>, every student is given the opportunity to shine, discover their potential, and achieve greatness. Together, we build a future where education empowers and transforms lives.</p><p>Welcome to <strong>[School Name]</strong>—where knowledge, creativity, and character come together to shape tomorrow’s leaders!</p>, imgageUrl=null, updateTime=2025-03-30T23:45:19Z, updateId=USER_ADMIN, recordNo=33, deleteFlg=false, schoolOwnerEmail=owner1@example.com, statusId=3), citys=[fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@5cffa13e, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@73f67a72, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@1737c0c1, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@394d1380, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@181aa3c6, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@587f6f5d, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@71e79d5b, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@20e741f4, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@6d2ed2bd, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@4e884dc2, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@3480c0d, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@19ba1571, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@29a87c1, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@e703c0d, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@4d9b71aa, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@4c3e4f5, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@52b1df23, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@5dae112c, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@4bae3d12, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@50d18cde, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@c450920, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@21cf4ef5, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@1b33a173, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@475879b7, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@63f07475, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@38133618, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@3e2d2050, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@3a3c63e3, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@5a0feb0d, fa.appcode.common.vo.CityVo@7b8db5a2, fa.appcode.commo